<title>USA: Jordan buys 100,000 tonnes of wheat - exporters.</title>
<headline>Jordan buys 100,000 tonnes of wheat - exporters.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jordan bought 100,000 tonnes of optional origin wheat at its tender on Wednesday, split equally between first half and last half October shipment, U.S. exporters said.</p>
<p>The wheat includes 10,000 tonnes of soft wheat priced around $200.00 per tonne and 90,000 tonnes of hard wheat at $206.00, cost and freight.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720</p>
</text>
